data: {"type":"response.output_item.done","sequence_number":1718,"output_index":1,"item":{"type":"message","id":"msg_09731aae4b2cc694016b094520f57087d1a108591c47ecdf1c","role":"assistant","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"{\n  \"queries\": [],\n  \"result_json\": \"{\\\"reviews\\\":[{\\\"actor\\\":\\\"kai\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"develop\\\",\\\"ability\\\":null,\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Develop physical shell opening and separation. The related-capability search and exact probe contract distinguish measurement from preparation: probe.press performs a material-consuming trial but does not produce separated shell and kernel; gather and pickup transfer existing material rather than open it. The recorded load-0.3 failure does not establish that higher force, a tool, or a supported cracking method will fail. No equivalent preparation function is established by the available registry. Remaining implementation questions belong in the current-conversation development handoff, with no world time advanced while waiting.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"General operation: Crack and separate a hard casing, parameterized by owned target item ID, quantity, owned striker item ID, support reference, and mode crack/separate/crack-and-separate. This is available for any applicable actor and physically suitable shelled material, not only this hazelnut instance. Minimal mechanism: controlled supported impacts followed by manual removal of accessible loose casing; no cutting, cooking, toxin removal or eating. Preconditions: living actor able to manipulate material, sufficient energy, target under exclusive work reservation and within 0.65 m, an actually owned suitable hard blunt striker, and a stable accessible support within reach. Validate tool hardness, integrity, geometry and support stability against actual material properties. A suitable real stone may serve as striker; neither a stone nor a support is supplied by learning. No known owned tool currently satisfies this requirement. start-1-stone is an observed source at (15,10.5), not an owned tool or an automatic usable support. Kai must independently travel, gather suitable loose material if actually available, and position it through existing actions with their own costs; the operation cannot silently perform those actions. If material/tool suitability cannot yet be represented, implement the minimal contact/fracture and component-separation mechanism in this handoff rather than treating the missing primitive as rejection.\\\\nContract costs: study takes 3 rounds individually, with ordinary time-dependent needs and no material consumption; it grants no item or completed work. Execution accepts positive quantities in the engine's representable material quantum; maximum 1 unit per job. Quote quantity, tool condition, exact phase count and maximum energy before starting. Each started block of at most 0.1 unit takes one cracking round at 1 energy and, if accessible fragments exist, one separation round at 0.5 energy. A failed cracking block does not incur an unperformed separation phase. Each cracking block performs one bounded supported impact, not an automatic escalation loop. Thus 0.9 units requires at most 18 work rounds and 13.5 energy for one pass, excluding travel, acquisition and study. Tool wear, material damage and any byproduct losses must follow a declared deterministic contact model; expose their cost bounds before authorization. Do not invent a tool-life figure or a shell/kernel yield from the pressure trial. Insufficient energy or invalid references prevent the next phase without charging it. Failed real impacts still spend their actual round and energy and may physically damage the sample or tool. Reattempts are new paid work on the remaining state.\\\\nImplement fracture using actual casing resistance, tool contact and impact bounds, then separate only components made physically accessible. Resolve any absent internal structure or fracture metadata in the development implementation, not by reporting hidden nutrition or toxins to the actor. No fixed success probability, arbitrary kernel fraction, free stock or guaranteed intact kernel. If the attempt leaves the casing closed, retain the affected target as closed or damaged and report that outcome. If it opens but no kernel is accessible, produce only the exposed fragments and residual material actually present. Products are owned, separately addressable casing fragments, accessible kernel material, damaged mixed material, and any accounted debris, with origin and parent references. Preserve original spoilage/contamination state and elapsed aging; processing cannot refresh food. Source quantity equals all resulting recoverable quantities plus explicitly tracked debris/loss, using a finer internal mass ledger if needed rather than rounding up products. Never copy the source into products while leaving its quantity intact. Wear debris likewise debits the tool. Opening establishes neither edibility nor nutrition, safety or toxin removal. Keep unverified kernel unavailable to any edible-resource shortcut until independently justified by the existing food rules; no automatic eating.\\\\nReference handling: resolve and pin exact item identities at start, reserve only the selected material, and revalidate ownership, reach, tool condition and actor state before each phase. Kai's candidate source is item-16-kai-161, quantity 0.9, origin start-1-nuts; item-4-kai-35 is unrelated berry stock and is not an implicit input. Evidence event-17-kai-172 supports only the recorded press outcome. Record actual parent IDs, tool/support IDs, quantities, work phase, completed block count and physical state after every committed phase. A pause or interruption preserves completed irreversible fractures and recoverable products, releases no duplicate stock, and permits resume only with current valid prerequisites. Cancellation releases surviving reserved material once; spent time, energy, wear, damage and scattered material are not refunded. Death cancels active work and leaves surviving items/products at the physical worksite under ordinary death/ownership rules, without resurrection or duplication. Global pause and development waiting perform no phases and consume no world time. No autonomous ongoing process; paused work and products remain subject to ordinary decay. Maintenance consists only of checking and replacing physically worn tools through independently available actions; no automatic repair.\\\\nDependencies and reuse: retain existing ownership, reservation, reach, energy, work-progress, inventory, decay and event infrastructure where present, and record the actual reused module IDs/revisions in the implementation change record. Existing contracts referenced, not reinvented: open.probe at foundation-open@1 for the already measured evidence only; forest.pickup at foundation-forest@1 for separately requested collection; base:gather:1 for separately requested source extraction. Do not claim unseen fracture code already exists or replace those actions with free transfers. The new handler must execute validation, accounting and outcome rules in code, with tests for failure, partial output, interruption, insufficient energy, death and replay/idempotency; no repeated model adjudication at runtime. Other actors, if involved later, must communicate and execute their own actions independently.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":3,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Functional preparation is distinct from experience. Requests, review, study, registration and nominal completion award nothing. A verified new observation of fracture, exposed structure, or a genuinely informative failed impact may qualify as information gain only when supported by an actual event and personally new evidence. Deduplicate by material/property/condition/evidence, including prior load-band evidence; repeated identical failures are not new discoveries. Optional experience implementation may grant at most